n_a629e6.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Tarun.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>My poor brother!</li><li>Why did he follow this woman? I told him she's evil!</li><li>I fear he is already lost.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>, next to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel%20Pass\">Kha'zeel Pass</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>He claims to trade spices, silk and ivory. His brother is missing since following a mysterious girl. Apparently, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dead%20Explorer\">Dead Explorer</a> found in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel%20Dragon%20Lairs%2FTiquanda\">Kha'zeel Dragon Lairs/Tiquanda</a> used to be part of his caravan. You can only trade with him after completing <a href=\"#/quest/the-lost-brother-quest\">his quest</a>. Part of <a href=\"#/quest/the-lost-brother-quest\">The Lost Brother Quest</a> and <a href=\"#/quest/within-the-tides-quest\">Within the Tides Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-